Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Previously on JoJo's Bizarre Adventure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the exit's blocked with ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more is coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, shits!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to cover the whole tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find a way out of this death trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't rip my paw loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.47,0:01:24.31,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,..end of world…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.52,0:02:55.65,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(640,686)\pos(150,877)}Episode 39: The Guardian of Hell, Pet Shop, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about to set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:02:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't Shade say three hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that cocky beggar had\Na bit more trouble finding
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's mansion than he thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I was expecting\Nthis to happen, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's better if he doesn't\Nfind that accursed mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, maybe he hasn't come\Nback because he did find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't occur to me until a moment ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a stand user is likely\Nto be guarding Dio's lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may have put that beggar's\Nlife in grave danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he hasn't already been\Nkilled. What? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I barely made it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ice caught my paw like a bear trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be dead if I hadn't gnawed it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna hide\Nout here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm down here long enough,\Nmaybe Birdbrain will go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After this is over, the Speedwagon\NFoundation can make me an artificial leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm still pissed as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you suffer\Nfor what you did to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something out there dove into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birds have the capacity\Nto dive underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like humans and canines, birds are\Nreliant upon lungs for respiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the average bird\Nhas five to six air sacs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stored away in its chest\Nand stomach regions.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.03,0:05:19.29,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\pos(201.6,108)\be(2)\c&HFFFFFF&}Air Sac
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.03,0:05:19.29,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(201.6,108)\be(2)\shad2\4a&HFF&}Air Sac
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.03,0:05:19.29,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\pos(1060.8,75.6)\be(2)\c&HFFFFFF&}Lungs
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.03,0:05:19.29,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(1060.8,75.6)\be(2)\shad2\4a&HFF&}Lungs
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.03,0:05:19.29,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\pos(1668,110)\be(2)\c&HFFFFFF&}Air Sac
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.03,0:05:19.29,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(1668,110)\be(2)\shad2\4a&HFF&}Air Sac
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's these pockets of air\Nthat give birds the ability to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remain conscious at altitudes\Nof six to seven thousand meters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a feat completely impossible for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it were to be strangled,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bird can survive for several minutes\Nthanks to its internal air reserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.86,0:05:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With these advantages, a bird can survive\Nunderwater much longer than a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like something's\Nheaded straight for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what could\Nbe coming after me down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that bird again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can it survive\Nunderwater like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did I fly off to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's its plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More icicles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three icicles are coming this way.
