Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The icicles are stopping the wall from\Nleaking, but at the rate they're spreading,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're going to cover everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what it's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.92,0:07:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's focusing on freezing\Nthe water around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's cut my air pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's trying to suffocate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its real plan is to bury me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use. It's collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bird is too powerful\Nfor me to hold it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by ice and freezing water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just my damn luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for finding a decent hiding\Nplace to lay low in for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.70,0:08:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to dig my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stupid day has gone from bad to\Nhorrifying in the worst possible way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First I lose my leg and now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some demon bird wants me\Nflattened into a frozen dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I can't hold it off anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to be crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to dig myself out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.18,0:08:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like someone\Ndug a tunnel down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the bird!
