Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting ready to\Nshoot another ice missile!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand is being held by the ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't defend myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's nowhere for me to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way you slice it, it's Dead time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let the dome break\Nand use the air pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to catapult me forward\Nlike a spitting bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got out of there alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dumb bird didn't have to\Ndie, but it left me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of us had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks like this will\Nprobably be the end for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been bleeding out for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hardly have enough strength in\Nmy body to keep myself afloat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let alone make it back to shore,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means I'm going to drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to live\Na trouble-free life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I saw that little face and\Nthose great big ears, I knew it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that stupid bird's\Nfault that you're like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It attacked you just like my dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pull through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.16,0:12:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bird's gone, so there's\Nnothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and hang on, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bird!
