Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that mangy mutt, where\Nthe hell did he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gotta stop pulling stunts like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get worried,\Nhe's been gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lousy fleabag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be someone following us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite, but I thought I heard a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like someone's calling out to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's... Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got injuries all over his body! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.06,0:13:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy's missing his front leg, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he got run over by a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not the kind of dog\Nthat gets into car accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were attacked by\Nthe enemy, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks as though someone\Ntreated his wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, they did a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't Iggy that I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever was calling out to\Nus was definitely human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy did have a run-in with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we found him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was half-dead in the arms of a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the Speedwagon Foundation\Ndoctors saw to his wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did the same for my eyes. It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finally back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to see you, Kakyoin!\NHow's it going? Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how are your eyes treating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We missed you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, they were able to treat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm ready for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While it's true I'll have a few\Nscars, my eyesight is back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all really glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going, Iggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have been quite indifferent\Ntoward humans and Stans in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now it looks like he's\Ntrying to lead us somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not aware of all the details surrounding\Nhis encounter with the enemy Stans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but judging from his resolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but that still doesn't\Nexplain where he's taking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recognize that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same fancy ride\Nthe beggar was driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this wreckage mean that he...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's strong enough to tear a hole through\Na car like a piece of wet newspaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem as though I was\Nright to be concerned about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should have never been involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible this is the handiwork\Nof the STAN user Iggy fought earlier?

